
  Nerd Quest 2: Edgar goes to Harvard.
  Written by: TinMan

    Id just like to say that Nerd Quest 2 is my first online game
  ive written and completed (I have many others in the works.) for
  Metro BBS system. Im not asking for anything for this progam and
  dont want anything for this program from the users.. Other than
  maybe some compliments or questions and errors found in the game.

    I also would like to thank Wraith for translating the original
  to Metro and the original unknown author for making Nerd Quest
  possible.

    Nerd Qest 2 is a pretty short game but if my users demand a third
  Nerd Quest i might make it about 100,000 bytes in size. I kept it small
  because I thought if i made it any bigger it might go into overkill..
  I guess i'll just have to find out... Hmm... thats about it.. Oh yea,
  Nerd Quest 2 was written in GFA Basic 3.0 for anyone who cares.

    I can be reached on Metro itself or on my BBS. Right now my BBS is
